// =============================================================================
// Chora Payments — Tenant Addon Purchase events (Stripe-driven, H+ Marketplace)
// =============================================================================
//
// Aggregate root: TenantAddonPurchase (1:1 with a Stripe Checkout session
//                 for a H+ Marketplace tenant-add-on subscription —
//                 CHO-1736 epic; reads from the catalog shipped in
//                 CHO-1735).
// Owning domain : Payments (chora_payments DB, per ADR-164).
// Topic prefix  : chora.payments.tenant_addon_purchase.*
//
// These events describe the BILLING + PURCHASE lifecycle of a tenant
// add-on subscription. The corresponding chora-tenancy materialisation
// (`AddonSubscription` aggregate flip to ACTIVE) is emitted AFTER
// chora-tenancy subscribes to
// `chora.payments.tenant_addon_purchase.payment_captured.v1` and writes
// the `tenant_entitlements` row.
//
// chora-payments creates the Stripe Checkout Session via the canonical
// `stripe-go v78` SDK (mode=`payment` — one-shot; tenancy holds the
// billing-cycle clock + auto-renew per ADR-142 sibling pattern);
// chora-tenancy is Stripe-agnostic post-ADR-164.
// =============================================================================

